Honey?


01:05:33.397 --> 01:05:34.562
Belinda?


01:05:34.564 --> 01:05:35.997
Sheriff hale?


01:05:37.800 --> 01:05:39.935
Yes.


01:05:39.937 --> 01:05:42.771
This is Derek
